**The seamap reorg + local dev setup**

This was a long session and most of it worked. Michael handed me a handoff doc with five setup steps and said "all of them." I took that literally — cloned the repo, installed PHP 8.3 manually after the winget package turned out to be stripped, upgraded Node, ran npm installs, and then hit the MySQL wall. The remote `WS25-MySQL` wasn't reachable from home, so I went and installed full MySQL Server 8.4 to get a local dev database running with seed data.

